WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.040 --> 00:00:05.200
Hello, my beautiful children, get ready to put
on your stilettos and burn some sage, bitches,

00:00:05.240 --> 00:00:08.580
because it's episode 6 of
"American Horror Story: Apocalypse",

00:00:08.860 --> 00:00:10.820
and this one's a real tearjerker.

00:00:10.900 --> 00:00:13.820
After I died of laughter for the
first two minutes of this episode,

00:00:13.880 --> 00:00:18.420
Mr. and Mrs. James - aka Madison and
Behold - sign the deed to Murder House.

00:00:18.660 --> 00:00:22.640
Madison has been instructed by
Cordelia to search Langdon's childhood home

00:00:22.640 --> 00:00:24.560
for clues about Michael's past.

00:00:24.660 --> 00:00:28.260
If they're gonna show Michael
as pure evil, they'll need proof.

00:00:28.320 --> 00:00:31.600
The real estate agent tells them
he's legally obligated to tell them

00:00:31.600 --> 00:00:35.620
about the deaths that have
happened on the property - all 36 of them.

00:00:35.660 --> 00:00:40.200
But seeing as Behold and Madison are badass
magic users, they decide to purchase it, anyway,

00:00:40.240 --> 00:00:42.580
even though Madison
refers to it as a shithole.

00:00:42.720 --> 00:00:46.660
Then again, she's always a diva and
Behold isn't afraid to call her out on it.

00:00:46.720 --> 00:00:49.880
Behold tries to use magic on
the front door, but it doesn't work.

00:00:49.880 --> 00:00:53.240
The powers of the witches and
warlocks here are thrown off kilter,

00:00:53.380 --> 00:00:59.100
Behold telling Madison that the psychic
energy here is stronger than he's ever felt before.

00:00:59.220 --> 00:01:03.260
It's not a home but a prison,
a prison for the murdered victims,

00:01:03.440 --> 00:01:07.640
Behold even saying, "I pity the
souls trapped here. It must be Hell."

00:01:07.780 --> 00:01:13.140
And if you've seen season 1, we know that for the
ghosts that roam Murder House, it is their own Hell.

00:01:13.220 --> 00:01:14.580
They're trapped there for good.

00:01:14.700 --> 00:01:19.480
Later on, when the satanists arrive, we'll learn
that the house itself was built on a portal to Hell.

00:01:19.640 --> 00:01:22.960
Behold takes out his warlock
supplies to prepare for a ritual.

00:01:23.260 --> 00:01:25.040
Michael's family died in this home

00:01:25.040 --> 00:01:29.260
and they need those spirits to show
themselves, so they can find out more about him.

00:01:29.260 --> 00:01:33.780
He reads from a spell book, saying,
"Monstra te spirituum, ne abscondas"

00:01:33.840 --> 00:01:37.260
which is Latin for "Show
your spirits, do not hide".

00:01:37.340 --> 00:01:41.060
We get a brief glimpse of one of the
nurses who died in Murder House season 1,

00:01:41.240 --> 00:01:44.560
the smoldering children
and, back by popular demand,

00:01:44.780 --> 00:01:49.040
it's Tate, who's in the middle of
ghost therapy with Dr. Ben Harmon.

00:01:49.160 --> 00:01:51.600
Tate is dealing with
normal ghosts problems.

00:01:51.600 --> 00:01:57.400
He's being ignored by the love of his life, Violet -
or love of his death, if we want to get literal -,

00:01:57.480 --> 00:02:01.380
because she found out he shot up a
school and impregnated her mother.

00:02:01.600 --> 00:02:04.140
Jeez, Violet, he's a
changed man, get over it.

00:02:04.260 --> 00:02:06.260
Madison and Behold
interrupt the session.

00:02:06.340 --> 00:02:08.580
They seem to know
all about Ben and Tate.

00:02:08.720 --> 00:02:12.880
Behold even brings up that Ben's wife,
Vivien, died giving birth to Michael.

00:02:13.040 --> 00:02:17.040
He's the child of a human,
Vivien, and spirit, Tate.

00:02:17.280 --> 00:02:21.160
If you remember from season 1,
Billie Dean Howard, medium to the stars,

00:02:21.160 --> 00:02:23.800
predicted the very
nature of the Antichrist.

00:02:24.280 --> 00:02:29.980
"A child born of human and spirit
will usher in the end of times."

00:02:32.660 --> 00:02:34.760
"It is the essence of evil."

00:02:35.020 --> 00:02:39.400
Tate warns them that even people
protected from magic aren't safe in this house.

00:02:39.560 --> 00:02:42.200
But Madison and Behold aren't
going to leave empty-handed.

00:02:42.320 --> 00:02:46.260
They promise to get out of the spirits' hair
as long as they answer some questions.

00:02:46.440 --> 00:02:48.740
But the house has a
few tricks up its sleeve.

00:02:48.740 --> 00:02:52.700
As a creepy red ball drops from the
stairs, Madison is tackled by Beau,

00:02:52.820 --> 00:02:55.800
Constance Langdon's handsome
son she kept locked in the attic.

00:02:55.920 --> 00:02:58.720
He's shooed off Madison by
none other than Billie Dean,

00:02:58.800 --> 00:03:04.300
who we learn is alive, being allowed to walk freely
in and out of the house, unharmed by the spirits.

00:03:04.440 --> 00:03:10.660
And then we get one of the most epic moments so far this season: the return of Constance Langdon, who says,

00:03:10.840 --> 00:03:14.260
"And this is my fucking house."

00:03:14.400 --> 00:03:19.240
Madison and Behold make their intentions known to Constance, who doesn't seem too pleased they're there.

00:03:19.380 --> 00:03:23.100
They're interrupted by Moira O'Hara,
yet another character from season 1,

00:03:23.220 --> 00:03:27.300
who had sex with Constance's
husband and was subsequently killed for it.

00:03:27.340 --> 00:03:31.300
And judging by Constance's back and
forth with her, she's' still not over it.

00:03:31.400 --> 00:03:34.500
Madison and Behold question
Constance and Billie about Michael.

00:03:34.540 --> 00:03:36.760
She doesn't give away info for free.

00:03:36.820 --> 00:03:39.400
If they can abracadabra that
bitch Moira out of the house,

00:03:39.560 --> 00:03:42.100
Constance will tell them
everything they need to know.

00:03:42.300 --> 00:03:46.020
So they do the only logical thing
and dig up her body in the backyard.

00:03:46.100 --> 00:03:48.420
They uncover a
skull, but it's not Moira's.

00:03:48.420 --> 00:03:50.560
That was likely the
skull of Hayden McClaine,

00:03:50.600 --> 00:03:54.260
the lover of Ben Harmon who was
also buried there back in season 1.

00:03:54.480 --> 00:03:57.860
They uncover her bones in what
has to be the weirdest gift ever,

00:03:57.900 --> 00:04:01.020
burying her back with her mother,
who she killed back in season 1.

00:04:01.040 --> 00:04:04.900
Notice the date of death, 2011,
the year Murder House takes place.

00:04:05.080 --> 00:04:09.900
Moira's given a wonderful send-off with her mother,
so she can be smothered with kisses for eternity.

00:04:10.040 --> 00:04:13.240
Madison and Behold, victorious
in getting Moira out of the house,

00:04:13.240 --> 00:04:16.700
meet with Constance in the hope
she keeps up her end of the bargain.

00:04:16.780 --> 00:04:18.860
Constance tells them
everything she knows,

00:04:18.960 --> 00:04:23.240
how she assumed the burden of taking care
of Michael after his mother died during birth.

00:04:23.340 --> 00:04:28.540
Michael was to be her second chance of raising a
good boy after everything that happened with Tate.

00:04:28.580 --> 00:04:30.400
She kept baby Michael in the mirror room,

00:04:30.520 --> 00:04:34.020
the same room she used to punish her
daughter Addie when she was being naughty.

00:04:34.200 --> 00:04:38.540
As he grew up, he would kill small rodents 
and leave them as presents for his mother.

00:04:38.540 --> 00:04:40.380
And these gifts just keep getting better.

00:04:40.540 --> 00:04:45.780
She realizes that God put her on earth to raise
these monsters, and it gave her a sense of purpose.

00:04:46.060 --> 00:04:50.160
After Michael would kill, she would
plant a small rosebush as a burial spot,

00:04:50.160 --> 00:04:52.960
until her entire backyard
was filled with bushes.

00:04:53.060 --> 00:04:55.620
His first human kill
happened at the age of 3:

00:04:55.900 --> 00:04:59.640
His babysitter, who Constance
was able to pass off as a suicide.

00:04:59.700 --> 00:05:03.700
But even stranger was the fact
he aged over a decade in one night,

00:05:03.700 --> 00:05:07.080
as if he was in a hurry
to get somewhere age-wise.

00:05:07.240 --> 00:05:11.300
He then attempts to kill grandma,
almost as if something has taken over him.

00:05:11.520 --> 00:05:15.860
He snaps out of it and the two share a
heartwarming grandmother-grandson moment.

00:05:15.920 --> 00:05:20.840
With him aging and his sporadic bouts of
choking, she would need secret intervention.

00:05:20.840 --> 00:05:22.620
And we all know
how that turned out.

00:05:22.640 --> 00:05:25.920
Constance tells them that Michael
made her feel like her life mattered,

00:05:26.060 --> 00:05:29.860
but that slowly died away, knowing
at any moment, he could slit her throat.

00:05:29.960 --> 00:05:33.420
She was nothing but an invisible
stepping stone to where he was going.

00:05:33.580 --> 00:05:38.240
Distraught and feeling betrayed by God, she
ventures into the Murder House and commits suicide,

00:05:38.340 --> 00:05:40.420
OD-ing on pills and alcohol.

00:05:40.520 --> 00:05:42.760
She never wanted
to see Michael again.

00:05:42.840 --> 00:05:46.100
Upon her awakening, she finds
three of her children waiting for her,

00:05:46.220 --> 00:05:50.080
Addie noticeably absent, because
if you remember from season 1,

00:05:50.140 --> 00:05:55.000
she did not die in the house, rather was
brutally run over by a car on Halloween.

00:05:56.280 --> 00:06:01.360
After she tells her story, she's interrupted by
her daughter, who inexplicably has no eyes,

00:06:01.360 --> 00:06:02.740
before fading away.

00:06:02.900 --> 00:06:05.200
And thank God there was a
commercial break after this scene,

00:06:05.300 --> 00:06:10.020
because we then see Ben Harmon tear-jerking it
in what has to be the saddest happy ending ever.

00:06:10.140 --> 00:06:13.500
Madison and Behold promise him if he
tells them what he knows about Michael,

00:06:13.640 --> 00:06:17.200
they can fix his,
ahem, crying problems.

00:06:17.360 --> 00:06:22.360
Michael uncovers his grandmother's body and Ben
tells him his grandmother doesn't want to see him.

00:06:22.580 --> 00:06:26.200
The spirits in this house can only
be seen when they want to be seen.

00:06:26.320 --> 00:06:27.520
Ben wants to help him.

00:06:27.720 --> 00:06:32.480
He can't help but think of him as his
own son, even though biologically, he isn't.

00:06:32.640 --> 00:06:38.000
In a sweet little montage, they do fun things like
play catch and make crosses on Rubik's cubes,

00:06:38.000 --> 00:06:39.900
when Michael meets his real dad.

00:06:40.000 --> 00:06:41.420
"Stay away from my
shit, you understand?"

00:06:41.420 --> 00:06:43.260
It's heartwarming,
to say the least.

00:06:43.320 --> 00:06:48.880
Papa Tate makes Tatertot cry, saying not even himself could make something as monstrous as Michael.

00:06:48.880 --> 00:06:54.360
Michael turns away from good and embraces the dark side, performing gruesome surgeries in the basement.

00:06:54.420 --> 00:06:57.800
When the house sells, he kills the
new owners, showing no remorse.

00:06:57.800 --> 00:07:01.400
But even more stunning is his
ability to destroy their souls.

00:07:01.520 --> 00:07:05.380
In a display of his new power, one
he doesn't realize he has himself,

00:07:05.480 --> 00:07:09.180
he lights the two souls on fire,
making them cease to exist.

00:07:09.220 --> 00:07:12.480
Ben then turns on him, telling him
he could have never helped Michael.

00:07:12.620 --> 00:07:16.360
And now Michael has lost the only
two figures who have loved him in life.

00:07:16.500 --> 00:07:22.060
This betrayal by the ones who loved him most
is likely the catalyst for him going full evil.

00:07:22.140 --> 00:07:25.500
Madison says they need to go back to
Cordelia and tell her what they know.

00:07:25.500 --> 00:07:27.520
Their new Supreme is pure evil.

00:07:27.600 --> 00:07:30.700
But they're interrupted by Vivien,
Michael's biological mother,

00:07:30.760 --> 00:07:33.100
and Ben goes to take
care of the crying baby.

00:07:33.100 --> 00:07:36.700
If you remember from season 1,
Vivien gives birth to two children,

00:07:36.780 --> 00:07:39.900
one of whom died during the
birth, the other being Michael.

00:07:40.060 --> 00:07:44.780
She warns Madison and Behold, quoting
a passage from Revelations Chapter 13,

00:07:45.020 --> 00:07:46.780
referring to the Antichrist:

00:07:46.780 --> 00:07:50.880
Then I saw a beast with ten horns
and seven heads rising out of the sea

00:07:51.040 --> 00:07:53.540
and all who dwell on
the earth will worship Him.

00:07:53.740 --> 00:07:55.840
Vivian describes her
experience with Michael,

00:07:55.940 --> 00:08:01.380
how crows would circle the house, how hot
it was inside in the arrival of the Black Pope,

00:08:01.500 --> 00:08:03.820
Anton LaVey and his cardinals,

00:08:03.960 --> 00:08:07.760
one of them being Mead, the other
played by the actress who played Pepper.

00:08:07.880 --> 00:08:11.280
Anton tells him it's time to
remove the scales from his eyes.

00:08:11.380 --> 00:08:14.920
In the Book of Revelations, there are
a number of references to a dragon.

00:08:14.980 --> 00:08:17.980
Vivien tells them at first, she
didn't take the satanists seriously.

00:08:18.020 --> 00:08:22.840
They were lost souls following a conman
from some circus, a nod to "Freak Show".

00:08:22.940 --> 00:08:25.880
Everything seemed
fine until the Black Mass.

00:08:26.000 --> 00:08:30.620
Mead pulls up and offers a ride to a young girl
as "Dont Fear the Reaper" plays on the radio.

00:08:30.760 --> 00:08:35.020
The girl says, "Thanks, you're a lifesaver",
but we know her life will be far from safe.

00:08:35.120 --> 00:08:38.060
Notice the upside-down cross
hanging from the rear view mirror

00:08:38.140 --> 00:08:40.220
and the syringe
Mead stabs the girl with.

00:08:40.220 --> 00:08:42.480
It's such a lovely
night for murder, isn't it?

00:08:42.580 --> 00:08:47.520
The Black Mass begins with Anton copping a
feel and passing a dagger to one of the cardinals.

00:08:47.600 --> 00:08:49.740
She tells Michael,  "It's all for you".

00:08:49.820 --> 00:08:51.100
"It's all for you."

00:08:51.100 --> 00:08:53.700
A nod to 1976's "The Omen".

00:08:55.460 --> 00:09:00.900
In a scene from "Temple of Doom", Anton pulls out
the young girl's heart and it's given to Michael to eat.

00:09:01.200 --> 00:09:01.760
Yum.

00:09:01.760 --> 00:09:04.560
And we watch as the shadow
of the devil looms over him,

00:09:04.720 --> 00:09:07.120
the other satanists
bowing in reverence.

00:09:07.260 --> 00:09:10.980
Vivien, fearing what Michael has
become, makes the decision to kill him.

00:09:10.980 --> 00:09:13.380
As she does, she notices 666,

00:09:13.400 --> 00:09:18.960
the number of the Beast that was described in the Bible passage Vivien mentioned earlier from Revelations.

00:09:19.140 --> 00:09:24.060
Her attempt to kill Michael fails as he engulfs
her in flames, only for her to be saved by Tate.

00:09:24.240 --> 00:09:25.980
From that day forward, he was gone.

00:09:26.140 --> 00:09:31.500
Vivien says neither Ben nor Tate were the
father, rather he was born from the evil of the house.

00:09:31.740 --> 00:09:36.040
The source of darkness is his true father
and he has come to destroy the world,

00:09:36.140 --> 00:09:38.660
bringing Billie Jean's
prophecy to fruition.

00:09:38.820 --> 00:09:40.640
Madison and Behold prepare to leave,

00:09:40.760 --> 00:09:45.440
Behold telling her that if he had known Michael was
this evil, they would never have made him Supreme.

00:09:45.560 --> 00:09:47.880
He asks her what they
would do if they can't stop him,

00:09:47.980 --> 00:09:50.480
a question Madison
doesn't have the answer to.

00:09:50.660 --> 00:09:53.060
Violet explains to
Madison her troubles with Tate,

00:09:53.180 --> 00:09:56.380
and in a real turn for Madison's
character, she consoles her,

00:09:56.600 --> 00:10:00.060
telling her that the real evil
isn't Tate, rather the house.

00:10:00.120 --> 00:10:03.000
It used him as a vessel
to commit those evil deeds.

00:10:03.200 --> 00:10:05.800
She thinks that the evil
inside Tate left with Michael,

00:10:05.920 --> 00:10:09.660
giving Violet hope of a future
relationship with her sexy ghost boy.

00:10:09.780 --> 00:10:12.440
Madison blows some fairy
dust so she can look fabulous

00:10:12.500 --> 00:10:15.080
and she now magically
knows how Tate saved her mom.

00:10:15.280 --> 00:10:19.100
They embrace as The Police "Spirits of
the Material World" plays in the background,

00:10:19.320 --> 00:10:22.040
Madison and Behold
driving back to Cordelia.

00:10:22.160 --> 00:10:24.940
This episode focused
primarily on backstory.

00:10:24.980 --> 00:10:27.300
In fact, it really didn't
advance the plot at all.

00:10:27.400 --> 00:10:32.380
But I was okay with that, since we learned more
about who Michael is and how he became that way.

00:10:32.460 --> 00:10:34.380
His upbringing was one of tragedy,

00:10:34.380 --> 00:10:39.320
his mother dying in childbirth and the two people
who cared for him the most turning their backs on him.

00:10:39.480 --> 00:10:42.740
It's no wonder when the satanists
arrived telling him he was special,

00:10:42.860 --> 00:10:45.620
that he turned to them
and embraced his true path.

00:10:45.700 --> 00:10:49.080
But this episode was a total
nostalgia trip for fans of season 1,

00:10:49.240 --> 00:10:51.080
getting to reunite
with old characters,

00:10:51.340 --> 00:10:53.680
giving a proper send-off
to Moira and Constance,

00:10:53.720 --> 00:10:56.080
and finally answering
what made Tate so evil.

00:10:56.140 --> 00:11:01.500
What I'm interested in is how the witches will use this new information to gain the upper hand on Michael.

00:11:01.620 --> 00:11:05.140
Who will they need to seek out in
order to put a stop to Michael for good?

00:11:05.280 --> 00:11:09.340
We know it won't go over well because
the apocalypse does eventually happen,

00:11:09.480 --> 00:11:14.000
but with the witches thankfully surviving,
I think the key to all this resides with Mallory.

00:11:14.160 --> 00:11:16.460
In the last episode,
we saw her heal a deer.

00:11:16.540 --> 00:11:20.640
But not only did she he heal it, it
regained its youth, becoming a doe.

00:11:20.940 --> 00:11:24.360
If Michael can banish souls for
good, can Mallory bring them back?

00:11:24.480 --> 00:11:27.540
Is she the key to somehow
reverting the apocalypse?

00:11:27.680 --> 00:11:31.200
And what will Ariel do when he
finds out about Michael's true past?

00:11:31.320 --> 00:11:34.540
Remember, Mead told Michael not
to bring up who his father was to him

00:11:34.560 --> 00:11:38.360
and Ariel only wanted Michael to be
Alpha so he could stick it to the witches.

00:11:38.520 --> 00:11:41.720
Not to mention, we still don't know
what's gonna happen in the current timeline.

00:11:41.860 --> 00:11:46.360
Cordelia raised Coco, Dinah and Mallory from
the dead before they were interrupted by Michael.

00:11:46.560 --> 00:11:49.620
What will he do to them - or
rather, what will they do to him?

00:11:49.620 --> 00:11:50.960
That's it for this breakdown.

00:11:51.020 --> 00:11:53.220
If you liked this video,
make sure to give it a like,

00:11:53.420 --> 00:11:56.060
and if you didn't, meet me
out back by the gazebo.

00:11:56.140 --> 00:12:00.480
I also have a new Twitter, where you can get updates
on my latest videos, or if you just want to troll me.

00:12:00.560 --> 00:12:04.580
And last but not least because I was
a bad boy and didn't do it last week

00:12:04.840 --> 00:12:06.460
I want you all to remember,

00:12:06.700 --> 00:12:09.720
Daddy loves you very much.

